  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Đồ thị hàm số có dạng một parabol đi qua gốc tọa độ nên có dạng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Từ giả thiết, đồ thị parabol đi qua các điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>87</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có hệ phương trình \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>43</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>87</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-alig